# Django Request Flow 🌐

## Django Flow

```text
Browser
   │
   ▼
URL (urls.py)
   │
   ▼
View (views.py)
   │
   ▼
Model (models.py)  ← Database
   │
   ▼
Template (HTML)
   │
   ▼
Response to Browser
```

## Key Points
- **URL** → Receives the request.
- **View** → Processes the request and business logic.
- **Model** → Interacts with the database.
- **Template** → Displays the data.
- **Response** → Sent back to the browser.........
